{# Prompt for generating a single recipe #}
{%- set num_recipes = num_recipes or 1 %}
{%- if num_recipes > 1 %}
Generate exactly {{ num_recipes }} different recipes based on: {{ instruction }}
{%- else %}
Generate exactly ONE detailed, practical recipe based on: {{ instruction }}
{%- endif %}

{%- if recent_meals %}
Recent meals (newest first):
{%- for meal in recent_meals %}
- {{ meal.title }}{%- if meal.summary %} - {{ meal.summary }}{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

Important: Generate a recipe that is DIFFERENT from these recent meals. Avoid repeating similar main ingredients, flavors, or cuisine types. Provide variety and balance in your suggestions.

{%- endif %}
{%- if constraints %}
Constraints:
{%- for constraint in constraints %}
- {{ constraint }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}

{%- if preferences %}
User preferences:
{%- for preference in preferences %}
- {{ preference }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
